Rochester. She said yes.

223
00:18:00,850 --> 00:18:01,770
Shortly after Mr.

224
00:18:01,890 --> 00:18:06,390
Rochester bought the hotel, he made an appointment to see the hotel manager.

225
00:18:07,510 --> 00:18:12,250
