00:19:20,470 --> 00:19:25,290
Years ago, I was given the task of organizing a conference in the south of England.

244
00:19:26,190 --> 00:19:30,610
I chose a five -star hotel, owned by Rochester, as the venue.

245
00:19:31,590 --> 00:19:35,730
Susan, the receptionist, helped me arrange everything perfectly.

246
00:19:36,930 --> 00:19:41,270
Once when we were chatting, I asked Susan if she'd ever met Mr.

247
00:19:41,770 --> 00:19:43,890
Rochester. She said yes.

248
00:19:45,050 --> 00:19:45,970
Shortly after Mr.

249
00:19:46,170 --> 00:19:50,590
Rochester bought the hotel, he made an appointment to see the hotel manager.

250
00:19:51,690 --> 00:19:56,450
When he arrived, the first person he met was Susan, who was cleaning the carpet.

251
00:19:57,170 --> 00:20:01,110
He chatted with Susan for 30 minutes before keeping his appointment with the

252
00:20:01,110 --> 00:20:08,310
manager. He spent all day at the hotel, talking with each member of the staff, from

253
00:20:08,310 --> 00:20:11,050
the top guy to the lady who cleaned the toilets.

254
00:20:12,230 --> 00:20:14,030
Six months later, Mr.

255
00:20:14,290 --> 00:20:15,830
Rochester paid another visit.

256
00:20:16,610 --> 00:20:21,470
Susan had been promoted to receptionist, but he recognized her immediately and

257
00:20:21,470 --> 00:20:22,650
addressed her by name.

258
00:20:23,370 --> 00:20:27,130
He even remembered that she had a little girl and what her name was.

259
00:20:28,010 --> 00:20:32,250
Now, I don't believe that Richard Rochester has that good a memory.

260
00:20:32,870 --> 00:20:37,910
He must have written a lot of notes after his first visit, and read them over again

261
00:20:37,910 --> 00:20:39,310
before that second visit.

262
00:20:39,970 --> 00:20:45,770
It's time -consuming, but it shows the importance he places on human relationships.

263
00:20:46,410 --> 00:20:49,370
I think that's one of secrets of his success.

264
00:21:13,350 --> 00:21:15,870
第二节到此结束。

265
00:21:16,770 --> 00:21:19,950
现在你有两分钟的时间。

266
00:21:20,210 --> 00:21:24,350
将试卷上的答案转涂到答题卡上。

267
00:23:27,410 --> 00:23:29,990
听力部分到此结束。
